<title>USA: Clinton CSD, N.Y., won by Fleet Sec..</title>
<headline>Clinton CSD, N.Y., won by Fleet Sec..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Sec. said it won $2.350 million of Clinton CSD, N.Y., school district bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.994 percent.</p>
</text>
